# Frozen raw evidence: NEVER touch line endings.
#
# These directories hold pipeline outputs whose SHA-256 hashes are recorded in
# their own SHA256SUMS.txt, in the pipeline's manifest.json, and in the paper's
# Methods section. With core.autocrlf=true a Windows checkout would rewrite LF
# to CRLF and every one of those hashes would stop matching, silently breaking
# the provenance chain. `-text` disables all EOL conversion in both directions,
# so a clone reproduces the bytes exactly as verified.
paper/era5_raw/**            -text
paper/mugla_temporal_raw/**  -text
paper/step9g_raw/**          -text
# Added 2026-08-13. mugla_transfer_raw was MISSING from this list and its working
# copy had already been CRLF-rewritten on checkout: 5 of its 9 files stopped
# matching their own SHA256SUMS.txt (the committed blobs were always correct).
# reproduction_check holds the five-region reproduction record whose SHA-256 is
# quoted in Methods 3.13, so it must never be rewritten either.
paper/mugla_transfer_raw/**  -text
paper/reproduction_check/**  -text
